From 40b9a929ebc17ea2fdb257bd154c0c06b9441f28 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: MYIR Security Team <support@myirtech.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 18:00:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] myd-jmx95: select signed FIT at runtime

The NXP common environment defines preboot=qb save after CONFIG_PREBOOT is
added to the default environment.  Consequently the board's preboot command
wins and the FIT selection from the security config fragment is never run.
The AHAB path then tries to load an OS container which is intentionally absent
from the dm-verity image.

Select the signed FIT in board_late_init(), after the saved environment has
been loaded.  Keep the existing sec_boot=no behavior: on this board that
environment variable selects the OS-container kernel path, while the boot
container itself has already been authenticated by AHAB.

Set a FIT configuration matching CONFIG_DEFAULT_FDT_FILE only when the user
has not selected one explicitly.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [MYIR board security configuration]

Signed-off-by: MYIR Security Team <support@myirtech.com>
---
 board/myir/myd_jmx95/myd_jmx95.c | 13 +++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 13 insertions(+)

diff --git a/board/myir/myd_jmx95/myd_jmx95.c b/board/myir/myd_jmx95/myd_jmx95.c
index d7ed295e8b6..1d427b85084 100644
--- a/board/myir/myd_jmx95/myd_jmx95.c
+++ b/board/myir/myd_jmx95/myd_jmx95.c
@@ -268,6 +268,19 @@ int board_late_init(void)
 	env_set("sec_boot", "yes");
 #endif
 
+#ifdef CONFIG_FIT_SIGNATURE
+	/*
+	 * AHAB has authenticated imx-boot.  Select bootm so U-Boot verifies
+	 * the signed kernel, ramdisk and DTB in the FIT instead of looking for
+	 * a separately signed OS container.
+	 */
+	env_set("image", "fitImage");
+	env_set("boot_fit", "yes");
+	env_set("sec_boot", "no");
+	if (!env_get("fit_config"))
+		env_set("fit_config", "conf-" CONFIG_DEFAULT_FDT_FILE);
+#endif
+
 	myir_set_data_from_eeprom();
 	env_set("u-boot_version", PLAIN_VERSION " (" U_BOOT_DATE " - "
 		U_BOOT_TIME ")");
-- 
